            "reason": "The statement attributes a quote to Nicos Pou lantzas, but the actual quote in the source text refers to both Max Horkheimer and Nicos Pou lantzas. The claim specifically attributes the statement to Nicos Pou lantzas, which is a partial attribution. The source text does not provide a direct quote from Nicos Pou lantzas alone, only a joint statement with Horkheimer. The claim's statement is a paraphrase of the source text, but it omits the co-authorship with Horkheimer. Additionally, the claim's statement is not a direct quotation but a paraphrased version of the source text. The source text is",
